      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREYSYND CLYDE (3) is looking to continue his winning ways off a useful 28.17 success in a Grade 5 at this track. In winning form and can measure up again. MONTANA ICON (1) drew the inside and won last time at this track and distance (28.32), scoring by a head. Should be in this for a long way. GREYSYND BONNIE (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at The Meadows over 600m behind Greysynd Sammy (35.53) in a Grade 4/5. Was a winner prior to that. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should be thereabouts. THERMAL FLAME (7) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
